  kanagawa.nvim: Copyright (c) 2021 Tommaso Laurenzi
    https://github.com/rebelot/kanagawa.nvim
    @ bb85e4bfc8d89b0e62c8fa53ccdd13d12e2f77b3
  kanagawa.vim: Copyright (c) 2025 menisadi
